    "question_en": "Point $P(3, -4)$ is reflected in the $y$-axis to point $P'$. $P'$ is then rotated clockwise about the origin through $90^\\circ$ to point $P''$. Find the coordinates of $P''$.",
    "question_zh": "點 $P(3, -4)$ 對 $y$ 軸反射至點 $P'$。$P'$ 再繞原點順時針旋轉 $90^\\circ$ 至點 $P''$。求 $P''$ 的坐標。",
    "options": [
