  {
    "id": "ct_sa_307",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_polynomials"],
    "marks": 9,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "When a polynomial $P(x)$ is divided by $x^2 - x - 2$, the quotient is $2x + 3$ and the remainder is $5x - 1$. Find $P(x)$.",
    "question_zh": "當多項式 $P(x)$ 除以 $x^2 - x - 2$ 時，商式為 $2x + 3$，餘式為 $5x - 1$。求 $P(x)$。",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Using the division algorithm: $P(x) = D(x)Q(x) + R(x)$.",
      " $P(x) = (x^2 - x - 2)(2x + 3) + (5x - 1)$.",
      " Expand $(x^2 - x - 2)(2x + 3) = 2x^3 + 3x^2 - 2x^2 - 3x - 4x - 6 = 2x^3 + x^2 - 7x - 6$.",
      " Add remainder: $P(x) = (2x^3 + x^2 - 7x - 6) + 5x - 1 = 2x^3 + x^2 - 2x - 7$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "使用除法算法：$P(x) = D(x)Q(x) + R(x)$。",
      " $P(x) = (x^2 - x - 2)(2x + 3) + (5x - 1)$。",
      " 展開 $(x^2 - x - 2)(2x + 3) = 2x^3 + 3x^2 - 2x^2 - 3x - 4x - 6 = 2x^3 + x^2 - 7x - 6$。",
      " 加上餘式：$P(x) = 2x^3 + x^2 - 2x - 7$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["polynomials", "division-algorithm"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_308",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_coordinate_geo"],
    "marks": 11,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Points $A(2, 6)$ and $B(8, 2)$ are given. The locus of a moving point $P$ is equidistant from $A$ and $B$.\n(a) Describe the geometric relationship of the locus to points $A$ and $B$. (2 marks)\n(b) Find the equation of the locus of $P$. (9 marks)",
    "question_zh": "已知點 $A(2, 6)$ 及 $B(8, 2)$。動點 $P$ 的軌跡與 $A$ 及 $B$ 等距。\n(a) 描述該軌跡與點 $A, B$ 的幾何關係。(2分)\n(b) 求 $P$ 的軌跡方程。(9分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) The locus of $P$ is the perpendicular bisector of the line segment $AB$.",
      "(b) Let $P$ be $(x, y)$. Since $PA = PB$, $PA^2 = PB^2$.",
      " $(x - 2)^2 + (y - 6)^2 = (x - 8)^2 + (y - 2)^2$.",
      " $x^2 - 4x + 4 + y^2 - 12y + 36 = x^2 - 16x + 64 + y^2 - 4y + 4$.",
      " $-4x - 12y + 40 = -16x - 4y + 68$.",
      " $12x - 8y - 28 = 0$. Divide by 4: $3x - 2y - 7 = 0$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) $P$ 的軌跡是線段 $AB$ 的垂直平分線。",
      "(b) 設 $P$ 為 $(x, y)$。由於 $PA = PB$，故 $PA^2 = PB^2$。",
      " $(x - 2)^2 + (y - 6)^2 = (x - 8)^2 + (y - 2)^2$。",
      " $x^2 - 4x + 4 + y^2 - 12y + 36 = x^2 - 16x + 64 + y^2 - 4y + 4$。",
      " $12x - 8y - 28 = 0$。同除以 4 得 $3x - 2y - 7 = 0$。"
    ],
