    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_309",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_stat_prob"],
    "marks": 10,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Two fair dice are thrown. Find the probability that the sum of the numbers is a prime number, given that the sum is greater than 5.",
    "question_zh": "擲出兩枚均勻骰子。已知點數之和多於 5，求該和是質數的概率。",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Total outcomes in $S = 36$.",
      "Sums $\\le 5$: $(1,1), (1,2), (2,1), (1,3), (3,1), (2,2), (1,4), (4,1), (2,3), (3,2)$. Total 10 cases.",
      "Condition: Sum $> 5 \\rightarrow 36 - 10 = 26$ cases.",
      "Prime sums $> 5$: 7 and 11.",
      "Sum 7: (1,6), (6,1), (2,5), (5,2), (3,4), (4,3) $\\rightarrow$ 6 cases.",
      "Sum 11: (5,6), (6,5) $\\rightarrow$ 2 cases.",
      "Total prime outcomes $= 6 + 2 = 8$.",
      "Prob $= \\frac{8}{26} = \\frac{4}{13}$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "樣本空間總數 $S = 36$。",
      "點數和 $\\le 5$ 的情況：(1,1) 至 (3,2) 共 10 種情況。",
      "條件：點數和 $> 5 \\rightarrow 36 - 10 = 26$ 種情況。",
      "多於 5 的質數和：7 及 11。",
      "和為 7：6 種情況；和為 11：2 種情況。共 8 種。",
      "概率 $= \\frac{8}{26} = \\frac{4}{13}$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["probability", "conditional-probability"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_310",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_polynomials"],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "The first row of a theater has 20 seats. Each subsequent row has 4 additional seats than the previous row.\n(a) Find the number of seats in the 15th row. (4 marks)\n(b) If the theater has 25 rows in total, find the total seating capacity of the theater. (8 marks)",
    "question_zh": "劇院的第一排有 20 個座位。隨後的每一排都比前一排多 4 個座位。\n(a) 求第 15 排的座位數目。(4分)\n(b) 若劇院共有 25 排，求劇院的總座位數。(8分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) This is an Arithmetic Progression (AP) with $a = 20$ and $d = 4$.",
      " $T_{15} = a + (15 - 1)d = 20 + 14(4) = 20 + 56 = 76$.",
      "(b) Total capacity $= S_{25} = \\frac{n}{2}[2a + (n - 1)d]$.",
      " $S_{25} = \\frac{25}{2}[2(20) + (25 - 1)4] = 12.5[40 + 96] = 12.5 \\times 136 = 1700$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 這是一個等差數列 (AP)，$a = 20$，$d = 4$。",
      " $T_{15} = a + 14d = 20 + 56 = 76$。",
      "(b) 總座位數 $= S_{25} = \\frac{n}{2}[2a + (n - 1)d]$。",
      " $S_{25} = \\frac{25}{2}[40 + 24(4)] = 12.5[136] = 1700$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["arithmetic-progression", "real-life"],
    "status": "approved"
  }
]
